    "provisos": "(M)(O) Right SMC may be inoperative provided: a) FMS is the navigation source on both PFDs, b) Destination and alternate airports have either LPV, GPS, FMS overlay, or ILS approach available without NOTAM restrictions, c) No other display system failures exist, d) Associated circuit breaker is pulled and collared, e) Procedures are used, and f) Repairs are made within 1 flight-day. NOTE: With SMC 2 failed, Pressurization Semi-Mode will not be available.",
